    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Come find me...</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/ed44c7bb8340ae5cbd5dc2bd8599e8df.poster.avif?t=1755237013\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/ed44c7bb8340ae5cbd5dc2bd8599e8df.webp?t=1755237013\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Soul</strong> is a 2D side-scrolling roguelite action RPG centered around elemental-switching combat and limitless item collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5a63fbd633a12b00ed91935929f08512.poster.avif?t=1755237013\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5a63fbd633a12b00ed91935929f08512.webm?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/5a63fbd633a12b00ed91935929f08512.mp4?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Elemental Soul, there are three main elements: <strong>Fire, Grass, and Water</strong>. Players can harness this mysterious <strong>power</strong>. With the right element, you can gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And if it\u2019s at just the right moment\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/7961d4ffde9c5acddbce818cfebd48ee.poster.avif?t=1755237013\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/7961d4ffde9c5acddbce818cfebd48ee.webm?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/7961d4ffde9c5acddbce818cfebd48ee.mp4?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you may discover <strong>treasure</strong> chests. Inside, you can find one of hundreds  of <strong>weapons and relics</strong> with diverse abilities. You can carry up to three weapons, and infinitely absorb relics to grow stronger.<br>Discover powerful synergies and craft your optimal build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/9c7327cbaab508831d165c5aa304bbac.poster.avif?t=1755237013\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/9c7327cbaab508831d165c5aa304bbac.webm?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/9c7327cbaab508831d165c5aa304bbac.mp4?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you adventure, you\u2019ll make <strong>choices</strong> that shape your path. Your decisions affect stages, future storylines, appearing bosses, and village NPCs. Even unexpected actions may lead to massive changes later!<br>So take your time to explore and uncover <strong>hidden secrets and untold tales</strong> throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/9452b41280056a1322fbb664c95ea661.poster.avif?t=1755237013\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/9452b41280056a1322fbb664c95ea661.webm?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/9452b41280056a1322fbb664c95ea661.mp4?t=1755237013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating a stage boss allows you to move on to the next chapter of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish 2D pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Element-based action combat with a hint of Soulslike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release Plan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon via update</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
